2026-10-23T16:52:37.1168230Z #region CheckIfExternalRulesetsAreSupported
2026-10-23T16:52:37.1169542Z Write-AlpacaGroupStart "Check if external rulesets are supported" #Level 1
2026-10-23T16:52:37.1170959Z try {
